    "committer": "GitHub <noreply@github.com>",
    "message": "refactor: one feature per demo, each under sixty lines (#165)\n\nThe grant SOW asks for focused example apps under 60 lines each. Four were\nover: the showcase app at 285 lines, and local-data.R at 130 because it\ncarried three unrelated track types.\n\nlocal-data.R is split by track type into gff3.R, junctions.R and a\nlocal-data.R that keeps BAM and VCF; the button ids the shinytest2 fixtures\ndepend on are unchanged, and the test that drove all of them is split to\nmatch. The showcase app moves to inst/showcase, which leaves inst/demos\nholding only the focused examples, and everything pointing at it - the\nConnect wrapper, the roxygen examples, the vignette - follows it there.\n\nThe makefile targets naming demo files deleted in #156 are gone; a single\ndemo-one target runs any of the focused apps.",
    "time": 1785576460
  },
